  <Markdown id="wj2_artifact_intro">
## My Writing Journal — Entry 2

This tab gathers your work in one place as you go, so you can see the whole journal at a glance — your
quiz results, your reflection on where you landed, the story you told, and what the Circle heard in it.
Come back any time to review what you have built, and use **Export as PDF** to save and submit it.
